#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Syslog Upgrade Advisor"
msgstr "Syslog savjetnik za nadogradnju"

#: includes/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Upgrade Syslog from %s to %s? Existing messages and rules will be preserved. Schema changes may take time."
msgstr "Nadograditi Syslog sa %s na %s? Postojeće poruke i pravila bit će sačuvani. Promjene šeme mogu potrajati."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "What upgrade/install type do you wish to use"
msgstr "Koju vrstu nadogradnje/instalacije želite koristiti"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "When you have very large tables, performing a Truncate will be much quicker.  If you are concerned about archive data, you can choose either Inline, which will freeze your browser for the period of this upgrade, or background, which will create a background process to bring your old syslog data from a backup table to the new syslog format.  Again this process can take several hours.  A Truncate discards the stored syslog and removed messages only; alert, removal and report rules are always kept."
msgstr "Kada imate veoma velike tabele, pražnjenje (Truncate) bit će mnogo brže. Ako ste zabrinuti za arhivske podatke, možete odabrati ili direktnu nadogradnju (Inline), koja će zamrznuti vaš preglednik tokom trajanja ove nadogradnje, ili pozadinsku, koja će kreirati pozadinski proces za prebacivanje vaših starih syslog podataka iz tabele sigurnosne kopije u novi syslog format. I taj proces može potrajati nekoliko sati. Pražnjenje (Truncate) odbacuje samo pohranjene syslog i uklonjene poruke; pravila za alarme, uklanjanje i izvještaje se uvijek zadržavaju."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Truncate Syslog Table"
msgstr "Isprazni Syslog tabelu"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Inline Upgrade"
msgstr "Direktna (Inline) nadogradnja"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Background Upgrade"
msgstr "Pozadinska nadogradnja"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Database Storage Engine"
msgstr "Mehanizam za pohranu baze podataka"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The storage engine for the analytical tables.  Only InnoDB and, on MariaDB, Aria storage engines are supported.  Any Remote Data Collector option requires InnoDB; incompatible combinations cannot be submitted."
msgstr "Mehanizam za pohranu za analitičke tabele. Podržani su samo InnoDB i, na MariaDB, Aria mehanizmi za pohranu. Svaka opcija udaljenog sakupljača podataka zahtijeva InnoDB; nekompatibilne kombinacije ne mogu biti poslane."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "InnoDB Storage"
msgstr "InnoDB pohrana"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Aria Storage"
msgstr "Aria pohrana"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Timestamp Precision"
msgstr "Preciznost vremenske oznake"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Millisecond precision stores sub-second syslog timestamps in a TIMESTAMP(3) column and is only available on MariaDB.  Second precision uses a standard TIMESTAMP column.  On a production system, use cli/upgrade_partitioning.php --convert-ms during a maintenance window to convert existing messages without discarding them."
msgstr "Milisekundna preciznost pohranjuje syslog vremenske oznake ispod sekunde u kolonu TIMESTAMP(3) i dostupna je samo na MariaDB. Sekundna preciznost koristi standardnu kolonu TIMESTAMP. Na produkcionom sistemu, koristite cli/upgrade_partitioning.php --convert-ms tokom perioda održavanja za konverziju postojećih poruka bez njihovog odbacivanja."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Millisecond - TIMESTAMP(3) (MariaDB only)"
msgstr "Milisekunda - TIMESTAMP(3) (samo MariaDB)"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Second - TIMESTAMP"
msgstr "Sekunda - TIMESTAMP"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Message Processing"
msgstr "Udaljena obrada poruka"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Remote Data Collector Message Processing"
msgstr "Omogući obradu poruka udaljenog sakupljača podataka"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "If your Remote Data Collectors have their own Syslog databases and process their messages independently, check this checkbox.  By checking this Checkbox, your Remote Data Collectors will need to maintain their own 'config_local.php' file in order to inform Syslog to use an independent database for message display and processing.  Please use the template file 'config_local.php.dist' for this purpose.  WARNING: Syslog tables will be automatically created as soon as this option is enabled."
msgstr "Ako vaši udaljeni sakupljači podataka imaju vlastite Syslog baze podataka i obrađuju svoje poruke nezavisno, označite ovo polje za potvrdu. Označavanjem ovog polja za potvrdu, vaši udaljeni sakupljači podataka morat će održavati vlastitu datoteku 'config_local.php' kako bi obavijestili Syslog da koristi nezavisnu bazu podataka za prikaz i obradu poruka. U tu svrhu koristite datoteku šablona 'config_local.php.dist'. UPOZORENJE: Syslog tabele bit će automatski kreirane čim se ova opcija omogući."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Data Collector Rules Sync"
msgstr "Sinhronizacija pravila udaljenog sakupljača podataka"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "If your Remote Data Collectors have their own Syslog databases and process thrie messages independently, check this checkbox if you wish the Main Cacti databases Alerts, Removal and Report rules to be sent to the Remote Cacti System."
msgstr "Ako vaši udaljeni sakupljači podataka imaju vlastite Syslog baze podataka i obrađuju svoje poruke nezavisno, označite ovo polje za potvrdu ako želite da se pravila za alarme, uklanjanje i izvještaje iz glavne Cacti baze podataka šalju udaljenom Cacti sistemu."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Store Records on Remote Collector"
msgstr "Pohrani zapise na udaljenom sakupljaču"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Keep processed messages in the remote collector syslog table after they have been delivered to the Main Collector. When disabled, records are retained locally only while the Main Collector is unavailable and are removed after confirmed recovery delivery."
msgstr "Zadrži obrađene poruke u syslog tabeli udaljenog sakupljača nakon što budu isporučene glavnom sakupljaču. Kada je onemogućeno, zapisi se zadržavaju lokalno samo dok je glavni sakupljač nedostupan i uklanjaju se nakon potvrđene isporuke pri oporavku."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Retention Policy"
msgstr "Politika zadržavanja"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Choose how many days of Syslog values you wish to maintain in the database."
msgstr "Odaberite koliko dana Syslog vrijednosti želite čuvati u bazi podataka."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Partitioning Level"
msgstr "Nivo particionisanja"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The size of each partition of the syslog and syslog_removed tables.  Daily is recommended.  Hourly requires a finite retention, and the retention and partitioning level together must fit the database server's partition limit.  To change the level later, change it in Settings and run cli/upgrade_partitioning.php."
msgstr "Veličina svake particije tabela syslog i syslog_removed. Preporučuje se dnevno. Satno zahtijeva konačno zadržavanje, a zadržavanje i nivo particionisanja zajedno moraju stati u ograničenje particija servera baze podataka. Da biste kasnije promijenili nivo, promijenite ga u Postavkama i pokrenite cli/upgrade_partitioning.php."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "Nadogradi"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Instaliraj"

#: includes/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Syslog %s Advisor"
msgstr "Syslog %s savjetnik"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "WARNING: Syslog Upgrade is Time Consuming!!!"
msgstr "UPOZORENJE: Nadogradnja za Syslog traje dugo!!!"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The upgrade of the 'main' syslog table can be a very time consuming process.  As such, it is recommended that you either reduce the size of your syslog table prior to upgrading, or choose the background option."
msgstr "Nadogradnja 'main' syslog tabele može biti veoma dugotrajan proces. Zbog toga se preporučuje da ili smanjite veličinu svoje syslog tabele prije nadogradnje, ili odaberete opciju u pozadini."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "If you choose the background option, your legacy syslog table will be renamed, and a new syslog table will be created.  Then, an upgrade process will be launched in the background.  Again, this background process can take quite a bit of time to complete.  However, your data will be preserved."
msgstr "Ako odaberete opciju u pozadini, vaša postojeća syslog tabela će biti preimenovana i bit će kreirana nova syslog tabela. Zatim će se u pozadini pokrenuti proces nadogradnje. Ponovo, ovaj pozadinski proces može potrajati prilično dugo dok se ne završi. Međutim, vaši podaci će biti sačuvani."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Regardless of your choice, all existing removal and alert rules will be maintained during the upgrade process."
msgstr "Bez obzira na vaš izbor, sva postojeća pravila uklanjanja i upozorenja bit će sačuvana tokom procesa nadogradnje."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Press <b>'Upgrade'</b> to proceed with the upgrade, or <b>'Cancel'</b> to return to the Plugins menu."
msgstr "Pritisnite <b>'Nadogradi'</b> da nastavite sa nadogradnjom, ili <b>'Otkaži'</b> za povratak u meni Dodaci."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also set the database storage engine for the analytical tables syslog and syslog_remove.  Only the InnoDB storage engine and, on MariaDB, the Aria storage engine are supported.  If using MariaDB, we recommend the Aria Storage Engine when no Remote Data Collector options are enabled; collector options require InnoDB."
msgstr "Također možete postaviti mehanizam pohrane baze podataka za analitičke tabele syslog i syslog_remove. Podržani su samo InnoDB mehanizam pohrane i, na sistemu MariaDB, Aria mehanizam pohrane. Ako koristite MariaDB, preporučujemo Aria mehanizam pohrane kada nije omogućena nijedna opcija udaljenog sakupljača podataka; opcije sakupljača zahtijevaju InnoDB."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You have several options to choose from when installing Syslog.  The first is the Database Architecture.  Partitioned tables are the only supported architecture as they prevent the size of the tables from becoming excessive thus slowing queries.  Traditional non-partitioned tables are deprecated and are no longer offered for new installs."
msgstr "Prilikom instalacije Syslog dodatka imate nekoliko opcija za izbor. Prva je Arhitektura baze podataka. Particionisane tabele su jedina podržana arhitektura jer sprečavaju da veličina tabela postane prevelika i time usporava upite. Tradicionalne neparticionisane tabele su zastarjele i više se ne nude za nove instalacije."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also choose the timestamp precision.  Millisecond precision (TIMESTAMP(3)) preserves sub-second ordering of incoming messages and is only available on MariaDB; MySQL installs use second precision.  This cannot be changed in place later without destroying the stored messages."
msgstr "Također možete odabrati preciznost vremenske oznake. Milisekundna preciznost (TIMESTAMP(3)) čuva redoslijed dolaznih poruka ispod jedne sekunde i dostupna je samo na sistemu MariaDB; MySQL instalacije koriste sekundnu preciznost. Ovo se kasnije ne može promijeniti na licu mjesta bez uništavanja pohranjenih poruka."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Aria storage is unavailable while any Remote Data Collector option is enabled. InnoDB has been selected."
msgstr "Aria pohrana nije dostupna dok je omogućena bilo koja opcija udaljenog sakupljača podataka. Odabran je InnoDB."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also select the retention duration.  Please keep in mind that if you have several hosts logging to syslog, this table can become quite large."
msgstr "Također možete odabrati trajanje čuvanja podataka. Imajte na umu da, ako imate više hostova koji šalju zapise u syslog, ova tabela može postati prilično velika."

