#: includes/settings.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Opće postavke"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Enabled"
msgstr "Syslog omogućen"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, records will be transferred from the Syslog Incoming table to the main syslog table and Alerts and Reports will be enabled.  Please keep in mind that if the system is disabled log entries will still accumulate into the Syslog Incoming table as this is defined by the rsyslog or syslog-ng process."
msgstr "Ako je ovo polje označeno, zapisi će se prenositi iz tabele Syslog Incoming u glavnu syslog tabelu, a Upozorenja i Izvještaji će biti omogućeni. Imajte na umu da će se, ako je sistem onemogućen, zapisi dnevnika i dalje nakupljati u tabeli Syslog Incoming jer to definiše rsyslog ili syslog-ng proces."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Forward alarms to Alarm Manager"
msgstr "Proslijedi alarme Upravitelju alarma"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Allow rules set to Alarm Manager to forward alarms. Syslog email remains the fallback; command actions run only for Syslog Alarming rules."
msgstr "Dozvoli pravilima postavljenim na Upravitelja alarma da prosljeđuju alarme. Syslog e-pošta ostaje rezervna opcija; komandne radnje se izvršavaju samo za pravila Syslog alarmiranja."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Strip Domains"
msgstr "Ukloni domene"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "A comma delimited list of domains that you wish to remove from the syslog hostname, Examples would be 'mydomain.com, otherdomain.com'"
msgstr "Lista domena odvojenih zarezom koje želite ukloniti iz syslog imena hosta, primjeri bi bili 'mydomain.com, otherdomain.com'"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Refresh Interval"
msgstr "Interval osvježavanja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the time in seconds before the page refreshes."
msgstr "Ovo je vrijeme u sekundama prije osvježavanja stranice."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Skip Total Row Count"
msgstr "Preskoči ukupan broj redova"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, the System Logs and Alert Logs tabs do not count every matching record, which can be very expensive on large installations. The page shows Previous and Next links instead of a total and page list, and Next is offered while more records remain."
msgstr "Ako je ovo polje označeno, kartice Sistemski dnevnici i Dnevnici upozorenja ne broje svaki podudarajući zapis, što može biti veoma zahtjevno na velikim instalacijama. Stranica prikazuje linkove Prethodno i Sljedeće umjesto ukupnog broja i liste stranica, a Sljedeće se nudi dok god ima preostalih zapisa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Max Report Records"
msgstr "Maksimalan broj zapisa u izvještaju"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "For Threshold based Alerts, what is the maximum number that you wish to show in the report.  This is used to limit the size of the html log and Email."
msgstr "Za upozorenja zasnovana na pragu, koji je maksimalni broj koji želite prikazati u izvještaju. Ovo se koristi za ograničavanje veličine html dnevnika i e-pošte."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Records"
msgstr "%d zapisa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum Syslog Processing Processes"
msgstr "Maksimalan broj procesa za obradu Sysloga"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When set above 1, incoming message processing is spread across parallel worker processes.  Each worker handles a disjoint range of incoming messages, speeding up hostname resolution and message transfer under heavy loads.  A setting of 1 processes all messages in a single process.  Worker processes are not supported on Windows or when the PHP pcntl and POSIX extensions are unavailable, in which case processing falls back to a single process."
msgstr "Kada je postavljeno iznad 1, obrada dolaznih poruka se raspoređuje na paralelne radne procese. Svaki radni proces obrađuje odvojeni opseg dolaznih poruka, ubrzavajući razrješavanje imena hosta i prijenos poruka pod velikim opterećenjem. Postavka 1 obrađuje sve poruke u jednom procesu. Radni procesi nisu podržani na sistemu Windows ili kada PHP pcntl i POSIX ekstenzije nisu dostupne, u kom slučaju se obrada vraća na jedan proces."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Worker Process"
msgstr "%d radni proces"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Worker Processes"
msgstr "%d radnih procesa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Command for Opening Tickets"
msgstr "Komanda za otvaranje tiketa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This command will be executed for opening Help Desk Tickets.  The command will be required to parse multiple input parameters as follows: <b>--alert-name</b>, <b>--severity</b>, <b>--hostlist</b>, <b>--message</b>.  The hostlist will be a comma delimited list of hosts impacted by the alert."
msgstr "Ova naredba će biti izvršena za otvaranje zahtjeva za podršku (Help Desk). Naredba će morati obraditi više ulaznih parametara kako slijedi: <b>--alert-name</b>, <b>--severity</b>, <b>--hostlist</b>, <b>--message</b>. Lista hostova (hostlist) će biti zarezom razdvojena lista hostova pogođenih upozorenjem."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Host Discovery Options"
msgstr "Opcije otkrivanja hostova"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Hostname Resolution"
msgstr "Omogući razrješavanje imena hostova"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, all hostnames are resolved via DNS lookup first (If enabled), using A and AAAA records. IPv4 and IPv6 addresses need no lookup, and IPv6 addresses are stored in compressed lower case form. If the DNS lookup fails, the system will attempt to resolve the hostname against the Cacti host table and replace it with the Cacti host description. If both DNS and Cacti lookups fail, records are assigned a prefix 'unresolved-Original_hostname'."
msgstr "Ako je ova opcija označena, sva imena hostova se prvo razrješavaju putem DNS upita (ako je omogućeno), koristeći A i AAAA zapise. IPv4 i IPv6 adresama nije potreban upit, a IPv6 adrese se pohranjuju u komprimovanom obliku malim slovima. Ako DNS upit ne uspije, sistem će pokušati razriješiti ime hosta pomoću Cacti tabele hostova i zamijeniti ga opisom hosta u Cacti sistemu. Ako i DNS i Cacti upiti ne uspiju, zapisima se dodjeljuje prefiks 'unresolved-Original_hostname'."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Skip DNS Resolution for incoming hosts"
msgstr "Preskoči DNS razrješavanje za dolazne hostove"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, the system will not attempt to resolve hosts via DNS lookups.  This is useful for environments where DNS resolution is not possible or not desired."
msgstr "Ako je ova opcija označena, sistem neće pokušavati razriješiti hostove putem DNS upita. Ovo je korisno za okruženja u kojima DNS razrješavanje nije moguće ili nije poželjno."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "HTML Notification Settings"
msgstr "Postavke HTML obavještenja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable HTML Based Email"
msgstr "Omogući e-poštu zasnovanu na HTML-u"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, all Emails will be sent in HTML format.  Otherwise, Emails will be sent in plain text."
msgstr "Ako je ova opcija označena, sve poruke e-pošte bit će poslane u HTML formatu. U suprotnom, poruke e-pošte bit će poslane kao običan tekst."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Format File to Use"
msgstr "Datoteka formata za korištenje"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Choose the custom html wrapper and CSS file to use.  This file contains both html and CSS to wrap around your report.  If it contains more than simply CSS, you need to place a special <REPORT> tag inside of the file.  This format tag will be replaced by the report content.  These files are located in the 'formats' directory."
msgstr "Odaberite prilagođeni html omotač i CSS datoteku koju želite koristiti. Ova datoteka sadrži i html i CSS koji obuhvataju vaš izvještaj. Ako sadrži više od samog CSS-a, potrebno je da unutar datoteke postavite posebnu oznaku <REPORT>. Ova oznaka formata će biti zamijenjena sadržajem izvještaja. Ove datoteke se nalaze u direktoriju 'formats'."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Data Retention and Partitioning"
msgstr "Zadržavanje podataka i particionisanje"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Retention"
msgstr "Zadržavanje za Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days to keep events."
msgstr "Ovo je broj dana tokom kojih se čuvaju događaji."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The size of each partition of the syslog and syslog_removed tables. A change is saved here but takes effect only when cli/upgrade_partitioning.php rebuilds both tables; until then, partition maintenance keeps the existing size. Hourly partitioning requires a finite retention. The retention, pre-create window and partitioning level together must fit the database server's partition limit, or the settings are not saved."
msgstr "Veličina svake particije tabela syslog i syslog_removed. Promjena se ovdje sačuva, ali stupa na snagu tek kada cli/upgrade_partitioning.php ponovo izgradi obje tabele; do tada održavanje particija zadržava postojeću veličinu. Satno particionisanje zahtijeva konačno vrijeme zadržavanja. Zadržavanje, prozor unaprijed kreiranih particija i nivo particionisanja zajedno se moraju uklopiti u ograničenje particija servera baze podataka, inače se postavke neće sačuvati."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Partition Pre-create Window"
msgstr "Prozor unaprijed kreiranja particija"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days of future partitions to maintain for partitioned Syslog tables, so that new partitions are always split from an empty dMaxValue partition.  Hourly partitioning always keeps at least 2 days."
msgstr "Ovo je broj dana budućih particija koje se održavaju za particionisane Syslog tabele, tako da se nove particije uvijek dijele iz prazne dMaxValue particije. Satno particionisanje uvijek čuva najmanje 2 dana."

#: includes/settings.php syslog_alerts.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Day"
msgstr "%d dan"

#: includes/settings.php syslog_alerts.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Days"
msgstr "%d dana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Partition Recovery Limit"
msgstr "Ograničenje oporavka particija"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When partitions are missing (for example after maintenance downtime), at most this many missing partitions per table are created on each poller run.  The remaining gap heals over subsequent runs; retention pruning stays deferred until the future partition horizon is fully restored.  Applies to partitioned Syslog tables only."
msgstr "Kada nedostaju particije (na primjer nakon zastoja zbog održavanja), pri svakom pokretanju pollera kreira se najviše ovoliko nedostajućih particija po tabeli. Preostali jaz se nadoknađuje tokom narednih pokretanja; uklanjanje po pravilu zadržavanja ostaje odgođeno dok se horizont budućih particija potpuno ne obnovi. Primjenjuje se samo na particionisane Syslog tabele."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Partition per run"
msgstr "%d particija po pokretanju"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Partitions per run"
msgstr "%d particija po pokretanju"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Collector Staleness Threshold"
msgstr "Prag zastarjelosti kolektora"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline health alerts warn when unprocessed messages, processing completion, or queued synchronization exceed this delay. The effective delay is at least three poller intervals and 300 seconds. Set to 0 to use 300 seconds."
msgstr "Upozorenja o stanju toka obrade javljaju kada neobrađene poruke, završetak obrade ili sinhronizacija u redu čekanja premaše ovo kašnjenje. Stvarno kašnjenje iznosi najmanje tri intervala pollera i 300 sekundi. Postavite na 0 da biste koristili 300 sekundi."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default (300 seconds)"
msgstr "Podrazumijevano (300 sekundi)"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d seconds"
msgstr "%d sekundi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Collector Backlog Threshold"
msgstr "Prag zaostatka kolektora"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The Syslog Status page shows a warning when more than this many messages sit unprocessed in the Syslog Incoming table.  Set to 0 to use the default of 10000 messages."
msgstr "Stranica statusa za Syslog prikazuje upozorenje kada u tabeli dolaznih Syslog poruka (Syslog Incoming) ostane više od ovoliko neobrađenih poruka. Postavite na 0 da biste koristili podrazumijevanu vrijednost od 10000 poruka."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default (10000 messages)"
msgstr "Podrazumijevano (10000 poruka)"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Messages"
msgstr "%d poruka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Alerts"
msgstr "Upozorenja o stanju toka obrade"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Notification List"
msgstr "Lista obavještenja o stanju toka obrade"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Select an existing Thold notification list for pipeline health alerts. Enabled list recipients are combined with the email addresses below, preserving BCC recipients. Lists require the Thold notification-list table."
msgstr "Odaberite postojeću Thold listu obavještenja za upozorenja o stanju toka obrade. Omogućeni primaoci s liste kombinuju se sa adresama e-pošte ispod, uz zadržavanje BCC primalaca. Liste zahtijevaju Thold tabelu lista obavještenja."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Email Recipients"
msgstr "Primaoci e-pošte za stanje toka obrade"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Comma-separated email recipients for pipeline failures and recovery. Leave blank and select no notification list to disable email; health remains visible on the Status tab and state changes are logged. Checks require the Cacti poller to run."
msgstr "Primaoci e-pošte razdvojeni zarezom za greške i oporavak toka obrade. Ostavite prazno i nemojte odabrati listu obavještenja da onemogućite e-poštu; stanje ostaje vidljivo na kartici Status, a promjene stanja se bilježe u dnevnik. Provjere zahtijevaju da Cacti poller bude pokrenut."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Reminder Interval"
msgstr "Interval podsjetnika o stanju toka obrade"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Repeat notifications for ongoing pipeline problems after this interval. Failed email attempts are retried no more than once every five minutes."
msgstr "Ponavljajte obavještenja za tekuće probleme u toku obrade nakon ovog intervala. Neuspjeli pokušaji slanja e-pošte ponavljaju se najviše jednom svakih pet minuta."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Alert Retention"
msgstr "Zadržavanje Syslog upozorenja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days to keep alert logs."
msgstr "Ovo je broj dana tokom kojih se čuvaju dnevnici upozorenja."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Suppression and Maintenance"
msgstr "Suzbijanje upozorenja i održavanje"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Days"
msgstr "Dani prozora održavanja"

