msgstr "Preporuka"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The supplier of the device or software that logs this message, for example Cisco or Juniper."
msgstr "Dobavljač uređaja ili softvera koji bilježi ovu poruku, na primjer Cisco ili Juniper."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Vendor"
msgstr "Proizvođač"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Identifier"
msgstr "Identifikator"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The message code to look for, for example %LINK-3-UPDOWN, RPD_OSPF_NBRDOWN or 4625. It must equal a whole word of the syslog message (letters, digits and _ . - /); a leading % is literal and must match as written. The match is not case sensitive. See How Recommendations Are Matched on the list page."
msgstr "Kod poruke koji se traži, na primjer %LINK-3-UPDOWN, RPD_OSPF_NBRDOWN ili 4625. Mora biti jednak cijeloj riječi syslog poruke (slova, cifre i _ . - /); početni znak % je doslovan i mora se podudarati tačno kako je napisan. Podudaranje ne razlikuje velika i mala slova. Pogledajte Kako se preporuke podudaraju na stranici liste."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Component"
msgstr "Komponenta"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The facility, module or subsystem that raises the message."
msgstr "Kategorija (facility), modul ili podsistem koji generiše poruku."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The severity the vendor documents for this message."
msgstr "Nivo ozbiljnosti koji proizvođač navodi u dokumentaciji za ovu poruku."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The message format as documented, including its variable placeholders."
msgstr "Dokumentovani format poruke, uključujući rezervisana mjesta za njene varijable."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "What the message means."
msgstr "Šta poruka znači."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "What an operator should do about it."
msgstr "Šta operater treba poduzeti u vezi s tim."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Links to the vendor documentation, one per line."
msgstr "Linkovi ka dokumentaciji proizvođača, po jedan u svakom redu."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Recommendation [edit]"
msgstr "Preporuka [uredi]"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Recommendation [new]"
msgstr "Preporuka [novo]"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "A lightbulb before the message marks matching recommendations on the System Logs and Alert Logs tabs. Click the message to read them in the details flyout. Hovering never requests the server."
msgstr "Sijalica ispred poruke označava odgovarajuće preporuke na karticama Sistemski zapisnici i Zapisnici upozorenja. Kliknite na poruku da ih pročitate u iskačućem panelu sa detaljima. Prelazak mišem nikada ne šalje zahtjev serveru."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Only the <b>Identifier</b> column is used for matching. The vendor, component, severity, message and explanation are shown in the details flyout but are never searched."
msgstr "Samo kolona <b>Identifikator</b> se koristi za podudaranje. Dobavljač, komponenta, ozbiljnost, poruka i objašnjenje se prikazuju u panelu sa detaljima, ali se nikada ne pretražuju."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The first 2,048 characters of the message are split into words. A word is a run of letters, digits and the characters _ . - / that may start with %. Every other character, such as a space, colon, comma or bracket, ends a word. In <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN: Interface Gi0/1, changed state to down</code> the words are <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, <code>Interface</code>, <code>Gi0/1</code>, <code>changed</code>, <code>state</code>, <code>to</code> and <code>down</code>."
msgstr "Prvih 2.048 znakova poruke dijeli se na riječi. Riječ je niz slova, cifara i znakova _ . - / koji može početi sa %. Svaki drugi znak, kao što je razmak, dvotačka, zarez ili zagrada, završava riječ. U <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN: Interface Gi0/1, changed state to down</code> riječi su <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, <code>Interface</code>, <code>Gi0/1</code>, <code>changed</code>, <code>state</code>, <code>to</code> i <code>down</code>."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "An identifier matches when it is <b>exactly equal to one whole word</b>, ignoring case. It is not a \"contains\", \"starts with\" or \"ends with\" search, and there are no wildcards: <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> does not match the word <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN-EXT</code>, and <code>UPDOWN</code> does not match <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>."
msgstr "Identifikator se podudara kada je <b>potpuno jednak jednoj cijeloj riječi</b>, bez obzira na velika i mala slova. Ovo nije pretraga tipa \"sadrži\", \"počinje sa\" ili \"završava sa\", i nema džokera: <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> se ne podudara sa riječju <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN-EXT</code>, a <code>UPDOWN</code> se ne podudara sa <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "A leading <b>%</b> is literal, not a wildcard, and must match the message word as written. An identifier <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> matches the message word <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, not <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>; an identifier without the prefix matches only the unprefixed word."
msgstr "Početni znak <b>%</b> je doslovan, nije džoker, i mora se podudarati sa riječju poruke tačno kako je napisana. Identifikator <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> se podudara sa riječju poruke <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, a ne sa <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>; identifikator bez prefiksa podudara se samo sa riječju bez prefiksa."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "When the syslog host is a Cacti device whose vendor is recognised from its SNMP system description or device template, and recommendations exist for that vendor, only that vendor's recommendations and those without a vendor are checked. Otherwise all vendors are checked, but an identifier made only of digits matches only recommendations without a vendor. When several recommendations match, the longest identifiers are shown first, up to three."
msgstr "Kada je syslog host Cacti uređaj čiji je dobavljač prepoznat iz njegovog SNMP opisa sistema ili šablona uređaja, i kada postoje preporuke za tog dobavljača, provjeravaju se samo preporuke tog dobavljača i one bez navedenog dobavljača. U suprotnom se provjeravaju svi dobavljači, ali identifikator sastavljen samo od cifara podudara se samo sa preporukama bez dobavljača. Kada se podudara više preporuka, prvo se prikazuju najduži identifikatori, najviše tri."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Identifiers that contain other characters, such as the <code>#</code> slot placeholder or the <code>|</code> alternatives in some vendor documentation (for example <code>%ASA|PIX-3-331001</code>), are kept and exported but can never match. Set <b>Can Match</b> to No to list them, and edit them into the exact code, for example <code>%ASA-3-331001</code>."
msgstr "Identifikatori koji sadrže druge znakove, kao što je rezervisano mjesto za slot <code>#</code> ili alternative <code>|</code> u dokumentaciji pojedinih dobavljača (na primjer <code>%ASA|PIX-3-331001</code>), čuvaju se i izvoze, ali se nikada ne mogu podudarati. Postavite <b>Može se podudarati</b> na Ne da biste ih prikazali na listi, i uredite ih u tačan kod, na primjer <code>%ASA-3-331001</code>."

